			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Yabe"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 722760101,
					"content": "#Hey, you're {NICKNAME}, aren't you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760102,
					"content": "I'm not sure if you remember my name, but I'm Yabe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760103,
					"content": "Well, hello, Yabe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722760104,
					"content": "Hello, hello, hehe!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760105,
					"content": "Speaking of which, you're quite the hotshot, aren't you? Taking on the Raiden Shogun first and then braving the darkness of Enkanomiya.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760106,
					"content": "Well, you could say that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722760107,
					"content": "Great! So I have a lead on a certain treasure trove, but it'll make for a dangerous trip. Are you interested?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760108,
					"content": "Though I've always been a fan of mysterious stuff, I'd prefer not to put myself in any great danger.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760109,
					"content": "Sounds interesting. Tell me all about it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722760110,
					"content": "So, I found this when I was patrolling the Dainichi Mikoshi.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760111,
					"content": "Though it appears to be a mere stone slate, I believe it's the key to finding Bunkoku's Secret Treasure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760112,
					"content": "Bunkoku's Secret Treasure?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722760113,
					"content": "Well, the name is all I know, as not many detailed accounts of Byakuyakoku have survived through Watatsumi Island's history.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760114,
					"content": "One version says that Bunkoku was the second Prime Minister in Byakuyakoku's history. He and the Sunchild bled the people white through heavy taxation and made a huge fortune. After that, he hid his treasure in a secret chamber inside the Dainichi Mikoshi.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760115,
					"content": "Finally, he concealed the treasure chamber using the Sunfire Phantasms and summoned vengeful spirits and tainted beings from the Ley Lines to guard it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760116,
					"content": "Bunkoku probably had an ancient-sounding name, something like \"Tyeseus\" of sorts. But nobody would care to record the story of a despicable traitor in detail.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760117,
					"content": "So, let's get back to the stone slate.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722760118,
					"content": "Indeed, it is probably the key to unlocking Bunkoku's treasure chamber. According to my years of experience in kaidan and mystery investigation—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760119,
					"content": "It reads... Um... It's on the tip of my tongue...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760120,
					"content": "It won't hurt to be honest, you know.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722760121,
					"content": "Actually, I found the slate in the storage room inside the Dainichi Mikoshi, and next to it lay a note that records both the ancient script and its translation.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760122,
					"content": "It seems that documents written during the transitory period all came with a translation alongside them. According to this note, the stone slate is directly related to the Bunkoku Puzzle.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760123,
					"content": "It also says that there are eight stone slates in total. So far, we've only recovered one. According to the note, the secret chamber is in a nearby location.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722760124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722760124,
					"content": "Could I trouble you to take a look there? I don't care about the treasure, to be honest. I'll be content so long as I get to see the Bunkoku Puzzle through to the end.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				}
			]
		},
