					"nextDialogs": [
						722761206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722761206,
					"content": "You tell Yabe what happened...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722761207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722761207,
					"content": "So, there really is a secret chamber concealed by the Sunfire Phantasms? But then something else happened along the way...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722761208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722761208,
					"content": "...And the chamber is guarded by vengeful spirits and tainted beings that can control people's minds. That's... horrifying. I'm glad I didn't go with you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722761209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yabe"
				},
				{
					"id": 722761209,
					"content": "Were you scared that you might hurt us?",
